# Default-deny build context (M10-02). Everything is excluded; the `!` lines
# below re-include exactly what the image needs. This is a PRIVACY BOUNDARY as
# much as a size control: docs/ (including any local docs/profile/), .env*,
# .git, and .claude/ are STRUCTURALLY outside the build context -- they cannot
# reach the image even by accident. Do not replace this with a blocklist.
*

# Workspace manifests + lockfile.
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Application + package sources (the build filters to what it needs).
!apps
!packages

# Container entrypoint.
!docker-entrypoint.sh

# Re-exclude nested junk that the broad `!apps` / `!packages` re-includes.
**/node_modules
**/.output
**/dist
**/.nuxt
**/*.log
